{"school":{"dbn":"30Q235","name":"Academy for New Americans","boro":"Queens","district":"30","district_label":"District 30","report_type":"EMS","report_types":"EMS","school_type":"Middle","grades":"6 to 8","status":"open","enrollment":57,"enrollment_year":"2024-25","address":"30-14 30 STREET, QUEENS, NY 11102","phone":"7182672839","website":"www.is235.org","directory_url":"https://www.myschools.nyc/en/schools/middle-school/70588","accessibility":"Fully Accessible","overview":"Welcome to I.S. 235, Academy for New Americans! As a Queens boroughwide program in Community School District 30, we pride ourselves on creating an inclusive environment where every student is seen, heard, and celebrated. Our school is dedicated to newly arrived immigrant students in grades 6, 7, and 8, providing a nurturing space where academic excellence, creativity, and personal growth are at the forefront.Our unique approach includes comprehensive language support through tailored programs such as English as a New Language (ENL), Transitional Bilingual Education (TBE), and support for Students with Interrupted Formal Education (SIFE). These programs ensure effective language acquisition and academic success.We offer innovative enrichment programs like S.T.E.A.M, Robotics, Hydroponics, World Language classes for high school credit, and Financial Literacy classes. These are designed to equip students with practical skills and ignite their curiosity. Our arts and cultural integration is enriched through partnerships with the Brooklyn Conservatory of Music, Lincoln Center, ArtsConnection, Urban Advantage, Behind the Book, Queens C.A.S.A., and NY Edge, allowing students to explore theater, dance, music, and art. Community engagement is a key part of our curriculum. We organize field trips to universities, museums, and cultural institutions, participate in local science fairs, and involve students in community service projects to broaden their horizons and instill a sense of civic responsibility. Student agency is central to our philosophy. Through our Student Leadership Ambassador Program, learners become confident leaders and community contributors. Social-Emotional Learning (SEL)-infused practices, along with access to counseling and social services, ensure that students are emotionally supported and socially empowered. Our Parent Partnership and Community Engagement Program strengthens our students' success by fostering strong family and community ties. We provide ongoing workshops, events, and multilingual resources to keep families informed, connected, and actively involved in their children's education. At I.S. 235 Academy for New Americans, we are more than a school\u00c3\u00a2\u00c2\u0080\u00c2\u0094we are a community where potential is discovered, nurtured, and realized. Every child receives the support, encouragement, and opportunities they need to thrive. Join us in shaping futures and opening doors to lifelong success.","start_time":"08:00am","end_time":"02:19pm","languages":null,"subway":"N, Q to 30 Av-Grand Av","bus":"M60-SBS, Q100, Q101, Q102, Q104, Q18, Q19, Q69","shared_building":"1","neighborhood":"Astoria","latitude":40.766947,"longitude":-73.923037,"coordinate_source":"geocoded","first_year":"2015-16","last_year":"2024-25"},"series":{"attendance_inperson_k8_all":{"y":["2020-21"],"v":[0.953],"st":["ok"],"n":[81.0]},"attendance_k8_all":{"y":["2018-19","2019-20","2020-21","2021-22","2022-23","2023-24","2024-25"],"v":[0.949,0.961,0.95,0.929,0.914,0.858,0.926],"st":["ok","ok","ok","ok","ok","ok","ok"],"n":[157.0,115.0,97.0,164.0,188.0,217.0,92.0],"c":[null,null,null,null,null,0.809,0.893]},"attendance_remote_k8_all":{"y":["2020-21"],"v":[0.95],"st":["ok"],"n":[95.0]},"chronic_absent_ems_all":{"y":["2015-16","2016-17","2017-18","2018-19","2019-20","2020-21","2021-22","2022-23","2023-24","2024-25"],"v":[0.922,0.9,0.888,0.834,0.929,0.868,0.755,0.619,0.388,0.674],"st":["ok","ok","ok","ok","ok","ok","ok","ok","ok","ok"],"n":[204.0,201.0,152.0,151.